{
  "root": [
    {
      "tool": "jd_status",
      "args": {}
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_start",
      "args": {}
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_fact",
      "args": {
        "text": "toy repo is ESM",
        "source": "package.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "interview"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_ask",
      "args": {
        "question": "Should greet() trim the name?",
        "header": "Trim",
        "options": [
          "No",
          "Yes"
        ],
        "recommended": "No"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_set",
      "args": {
        "key": "repos",
        "value": [
          {
            "path": "/Users/ishansh-a4b/.dsh-test/work/toy",
            "mode": "worktree"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_set",
      "args": {
        "key": "permissions",
        "value": {
          "push": false,
          "pr": false,
          "remoteWrites": [],
          "debugEnv": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_set",
      "args": {
        "key": "budget",
        "value": {
          "timeMin": 30,
          "tokens": 5000000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_set",
      "args": {
        "key": "models",
        "value": {
          "planner": {
            "provider": "$PROVIDER",
            "model": "$MODEL"
          },
          "builder": {
            "provider": "$PROVIDER",
            "model": "$MODEL"
          },
          "checker": {
            "provider": "$PROVIDER",
            "model": "$MODEL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_set",
      "args": {
        "key": "crossModel",
        "value": {
          "enabled": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_set",
      "args": {
        "key": "dial",
        "value": "balanced"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "prd_parity"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_parity",
      "args": {
        "key": "prd",
        "restatement": "Add greet(name) and export it."
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "requirements"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_write_doc",
      "args": {
        "key": "requirements",
        "content": "# Greet — Requirements\n## Highlights\n### What gets built\n- greet\n### What doesn't\n- i18n\n### Decisions & assumptions\n- none\n### What needs you\n- nothing\n## Requirements\n- **A1 Greet.** greet(name) returns \"Hello, <name>!\".\n- **B1 Export.** index.js exports greet.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_parity",
      "args": {
        "key": "requirements",
        "restatement": "A1 greet, B1 export."
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "verification_plan"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_write_doc",
      "args": {
        "key": "verificationPlan",
        "content": "# VP\n## Highlights\n### What gets built\n- checks\n### What doesn't\n- i18n\n### Decisions & assumptions\n- none\n### What needs you\n- nothing\n## Checks\n| ID | Kind | Check | Proves | Command |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| U1 | automated | greet works | A1 | `node -e \"import('./greet.js').then(m=>process.exit(m.greet('Bo')==='Hello, Bo!'?0:1))\"` |\n| U2 | automated | export works | B1 | `node -e \"import('./index.js').then(m=>process.exit(typeof m.greet==='function'?0:1))\"` |\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_parity",
      "args": {
        "key": "verificationPlan",
        "restatement": "U1 and U2, both automated."
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "specs"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_write_doc",
      "args": {
        "key": "specs",
        "content": "# Specs\n- **S1 greet.** greet.js exports greet [A1]\n- **S2 export.** index.js re-exports greet [B1]\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "implementation_plan"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_write_doc",
      "args": {
        "key": "implementationPlan",
        "content": "# Plan\n| Step | Work | Specs | Checks |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| P1 | greet | S1 | U1 |\n| P2 | export | S2 | U2 |\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_tree",
      "args": {
        "op": "init"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_tree",
      "args": {
        "op": "split",
        "nodeId": "N",
        "children": [
          {
            "title": "greet()",
            "doneWhen": [
              "greet returns the greeting"
            ],
            "covers": [
              "N#A1"
            ],
            "traces": {
              "requirements": [
                "A1"
              ]
            },
            "kind": "behaviour",
            "checks": [
              {
                "command": "node -e \"import('./greet.js').then(m=>process.exit(m.greet('Bo')==='Hello, Bo!'?0:1))\"",
                "cwd": "/Users/ishansh-a4b/.dsh-test/work/toy"
              }
            ],
            "provides": [
              {
                "name": "greet",
                "description": "greet(name): string"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "export",
            "doneWhen": [
              "index.js exports greet"
            ],
            "covers": [
              "N#B1"
            ],
            "traces": {
              "requirements": [
                "B1"
              ]
            },
            "kind": "behaviour",
            "checks": [
              {
                "command": "node -e \"import('./index.js').then(m=>process.exit(typeof m.greet==='function'?0:1))\"",
                "cwd": "/Users/ishansh-a4b/.dsh-test/work/toy"
              }
            ],
            "dependsOn": [
              "#1"
            ],
            "uses": [
              "C:N.1:greet"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "preflight"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_preflight",
      "args": {
        "items": [
          {
            "what": "node runs",
            "command": "node --version"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_advance",
      "args": {
        "to": "final_parity"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_prepare",
      "args": {}
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_parity",
      "args": {
        "key": "final",
        "restatement": "Build greet + export in a worktree, no push."
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "jd_run",
      "args": {}
    },
    {
      "text": "The build loop started; you can step away."
    },
    {
      "text": "REPORT RELAYED"
    }
  ],
  "workers": [
    {
      "match": "^You are a junior-dev builder[\\s\\S]*Your item: N\\.1 ",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "bash",
          "args": {
            "description": "write greet.js",
            "command": "cd $WORKDIR && printf 'export const greet = (n) => `Hello, ${n}!`;\\n' > greet.js && cat greet.js"
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "jd_submit",
          "args": {
            "summary": "greet.js added"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "done"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "match": "^You are a junior-dev builder[\\s\\S]*Your item: N\\.2 ",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "bash",
          "args": {
            "description": "write index.js",
            "command": "cd $WORKDIR && printf \"export { greet } from './greet.js';\\n\" > index.js"
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "bash",
          "args": {
            "description": "try a push",
            "command": "git push origin HEAD"
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "jd_submit",
          "args": {
            "summary": "export added"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "done"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}